ity Operations Centre for security monitoring and incident management services; Quantum-Safe Data Vault for privacy sensitive information; Secure API Gateway, an API integration platform; AI in a Box, a modular AI platform; analytics as a service; and Data Stack Portfolio comprising RISE with Protean, eSignPro, Account Aggregator, and AI-driven CKYC and Onboarding. Additionally, it is involved in the development of interoperable digital platforms; the operation of a network of PAN and TIN facilitation centres. The company was formerly known as NSDL e-Governance Infrastructure Limited and changed its name to Protean eGov Technologies Limited in October 2021. Protean eGov Technologies Limited was incorporated in 1995 and is headquartered in Mumbai, India.","employees":839,"earnDates":[],"exDiv":1787875200,"asOf":1795613234},"analyst":{"key":null,"mean":null,"n":2,"tMean":727.5,"tHigh":825,"tLow":630,"tMed":727.5,"currency":"INR","asOf":1795613234,"trend":{"strongBuy":0,"buy":1,"hold":1,"sell":0,"strongSell":0}},"cap":"Other","caFix":null,"fetched":1795613234,"source":"Yahoo Finance (public chart, fundamentals-timeseries & quoteSummary endpoints)","news":{"q":"\"Protean eGov Technologies\" when:90d","items":[{"t":"Protean eGov Technologies (NSE:PROTEAN) Signs Five-Year MoU with UP Police","s":"Kalkine India","d":1795517700,"u":"https://news.google.?oc=5","g":["ord"]},{"t":"Why Is Protean eGov Technologies Share Price Falling","s":"Univest","d":1795493243,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigwFBVV95cUxPQ0xZeG5RUGk1UWM4ZFpfQ09VZ1BzQ21DYWhKYUJnYWNUaHU2NTMyeDVWT0hDNnVxVnpIZVZKS2ExNzE4eGhoTTl3X1NSR19Ic1pBMENLNV9zQnM1cjdFbTdrdjNRenFjTmxxRTRTSUNvdFU3dkMzQW1vNkVFOHB5MnZvcw?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"Protean eGov Technologies: Corporate Transaction and What Happen","s":"Kalkine India","d":1795451160,"u":"https://news.google.?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"Protean eGov Technologies, UP Police Sign Five-Year MoU for Digital Policing","s":"News Arena India","d":1795440415,"u":"https://new